        "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/eshad/macscp/zipball/v1.1.0",
        "body": "## MacSCP v1.1.0\n\nNative macOS SFTP/FTP client — dual-pane file manager with drag-and-drop transfers.\n\n### What's new\n- **Premium redesign** — unified title bar, real Finder file icons, clickable breadcrumb paths, hover rows, glowing drop targets, new indigo accent\n- **Redesigned Connect dialog** — fixed sidebar overlap, aligned card sections, inline test result banner\n- **Faster connecting** — SFTP connects in a single round trip; skips slow GSSAPI auth probes\n- **Cancel while connecting** — live \"Connecting…\" screen with elapsed time and Cancel (Esc)\n- **FTP / FTPS support**\n- Upload (⌘U) / Download (⌘D) buttons in pane headers; slim transfers bar when idle\n\n### Download\n- **MacSCP.dmg** — macOS 13.0+",
        "short_description_html": "<h2>MacSCP v1.1.0</h2>\n<p>Native macOS SFTP/FTP client — dual-pane file manager with drag-and-drop transfers.</p>\n<h3>What's new</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium redesign</strong> — unified title bar, real Finder file icons, clickable breadcrumb path…</li>\n</ul>",
